<title>EGYPT: Egyptian pound overnight, one-week rates rise.</title>
<headline>Egyptian pound overnight, one-week rates rise.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound rose in a liquid market on Sunday to between 10 and 10.25 from 9.5 and 10 percent on Thursday, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates also rose to between 10 and 10.375 percent from Thursday's 9.75 percent.</p>
<p>State-owned banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10.5 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
